**Example Method Claim**

1. A computer-implemented method comprising:  
   receiving, by an initiating application, a user selection of a document stored in a cloud-based storage system;  
   generating a request comprising a document identifier associated with the selected document and a user identifier associated with the user;  
   transmitting the request to a local helper application executing on a user computing device;  
   identifying, by the local helper application, a locally stored file having an identifier corresponding to the document identifier;  
   determining, by the local helper application, one or more applications installed on the user computing device and capable of opening the locally stored file;  
   receiving a selection of an application from among the one or more applications; and  
   causing, by the initiating application, the locally stored file to be opened by the selected application.
